  "name": "Narrative Reporting Agent DSHRZ",
  "description": "The Narrative Reporting Document AI Agent is built to help you quickly retrieve and present information from a wide range of reporting packages. It makes it easy to access important documents, such as the IT Project Approval packages. With this tool, you can easily search for specific data points or generate summaries from these resources. The agent saves you time by reducing the need for manual document searches and ensures you have relevant information readily available. This is particularly helpful when compiling reports, conducting analyses, or preparing for audits. By centralizing access to key financial and compliance documents, the agent streamlines and simplifies your reporting processes.",
